      "“The house doesn’t have a gas leak, Carol.”",
      "“The first buyer said the interior was Victorian. Crown molding. Velvet drapes. A chandelier.”",
      "“It’s a colonial from the forties. There’s no chandelier. There’s a ceiling fan that sounds like it’s chewing.”",
